c:Tc8f,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","url":"http://localhost:3000/en/faq","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"When do I hear back after subscribing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Within 48 working hours. Working days are Sunday to Thursday, 12 pm to 9 pm, and contact is on WhatsApp."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does follow-up work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You send the weekly review on your review day, and I reply with recorded adjustments (video or voice). On the Basic plan the review is every two weeks. Daily contact is on WhatsApp, with replies within 48 hours."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it suitable for complete beginners?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The program is built on your current level, every exercise is explained, and you can send clips of your form for technique correction."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I train at home. What equipment do I need?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The questionnaire has a field for the equipment you have (dumbbells, resistance bands, barbell…) and your plan is built around it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I pay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"By bank transfer after filling in the questionnaire. As soon as you submit it, your order number, the amount, and the account details appear. Transfer the amount, then upload a photo of the receipt from your order page. Your subscription is confirmed once the payment is verified."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the money-back guarantee conditions?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"On 3-month subscriptions to the follow-up plans (Intensive, Advanced, Basic): if none of your progress indicators improves after 12 weeks, the full amount is refunded. Progress indicators (by goal): weekly average weight, waist circumference, or strength in the main lifts (weight or reps). Guarantee conditions: - Send the weekly review every week. - Take measurements regularly. - Film your exercises and send them. - Follow the custom nutrition plan (on plans that include nutrition). Request the refund on WhatsApp within 14 days of the end of the three months."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I keep the plans after my subscription ends?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. All plans are yours for life, and you can edit them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the free renewal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A reward for consistency: a 3-month subscription earns 3 extra months free, so you get 6 months for the price of 3. Conditions: - Adherence of 90% or more: weekly reviews sent and workouts logged. - Clear progress in the same indicators listed in the guarantee. - Male trainees: send before-and-after photos to the coach for documentation, with face and navel covered. Posting photos on social media is entirely optional and does not affect your eligibility."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who can see my data?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only the coach, and it is used to design your program and follow up with you. Your results or photos are never published without your explicit consent in the form."}}]}b:[["children",{"s":"__PAGE__","h":160,"d":{"r":["$","$4","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"pub","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$c"}}],"$Ld","$Le"]}],["$Lf"],"$L10"]}],"p":"$@11","v":null,"s":"$a"}}]]
